The '''Istabith Falls''' were [[water]]falls located on the [[Core Worlds]] [[planet]] [[Alderaan]] that shared their name with the [[Istabith range]], a [[mountain]] range on the same world. During her [[Youngling|youth]], the [[Alderaanian]] [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] visited the waterfalls to relax.<ref name="LPOA" />

In [[3 BBY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of ''[[Leia, Princess of Alderaan]]'' to [[3 BBY]].</ref> Organa returned to Alderaan's [[Royal Palace of Alderaan|royal palace]] after traveling off-planet and wished to visit the Istabith Falls to refresh her state of mind. However, she was instead required to attend the reception of her [[parent]]s' dinner party, souring her mood further.<ref name="LPOA" /> In [[1 BBY]],<ref name="Destruction" /> Alderaan was destroyed by the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]] [[battle station]].<ref name="ANH">{{Film|IV}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
Istabith Falls were mentioned in ''[[Leia, Princess of Alderaan]]'', a [[2017]] young-adult novel written by [[Claudia Gray]].<ref name="LPOA" />

